# Hopeful Initiate removes +1/+1 counters "from among creatures you control" (CR 118.3, 122.1): a land's counters pay it only
# while the land is a creature. On turn 3 Bot1 animates Mutavault, Luminarch Aspirant puts a +1/+1 counter on it, and the
# Initiate trains attacking beside the 3/3 Mutavault. On turn 5 the Initiate's counter and the counter on Mutavault, a land
# and no creature now, are two counters on two permanents but one on a creature: the ability is not offered. Once Mutavault
# is animated again, the two counters pay it and it destroys Bot2's Weaponize the Monsters, an enchantment.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mutavault
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Hopeful Initiate
Luminarch Aspirant
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Weaponize the Monsters
Mountain x18

